    "identifier": "ullr-ammo",
    "description": "<p>You raise your weapon and combine the Yin and Yang Chakras within yourself before tethering the combination to your weapon. For the duration, each time you roll an Ammunition Die as part of a Taijutsu attack, you can choose to instead reduce the size of your ammunition die by 1 step. If you do, the affected creature that you deal [Weapon damage] to becomes Skadi Marked until the end of your next turn.</p>",
